1) 服务端要输入（input_required）:
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":7,"result":{"resultType":"input_required","inputRequests":{"__main__:approval":{"method":"elicitation/create","params":{"mode":"form","message":"批准 A1680 退款 680 元？","requestedSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"approved":{"type":"boolean"},"note":{"type":"string"}},"required":["approved"]}}}},"requestState":"st_7Qm2Xk9pR4vN8sT1cL6hF3dW0aZ5bY","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"shop-mcp","version":"0.1"}}}}

2) 客户端重试同一个调用（新 id）:
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"refund","arguments":{"order_id":"A1680","amount":680},"inputResponses":{"__main__:approval":{"action":"accept","content":{"approved":true,"note":"M01"}}},"requestState":"st_7Qm2Xk9pR4vN8sT1cL6hF3dW0aZ5bY","_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion":"2026-07-28","io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo":{"name":"book-client","version":"0.1"},"io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities":{"elicitation":{}}}}}

3) 服务端完成:
{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":8,"result":{"resultType":"complete","content":[{"type":"text","text":"已退款 A1680，680 元，批准人 M01"}],"structuredContent":{"order_id":"A1680","refunded":680.0,"approved_by":"M01"},"_meta":{"io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo":{"name":"shop-mcp","version":"0.1"}}}}

校验通过：inputResponses 的 key 对得上，requestState 原样带回，id 7 → 8。
